  title: CRIME WAVE
  description: Pontiff, reports tell of a violent crime wave sweeping the Warrens
    following the murder of a local gang boss, who seemed to be the only one keeping
    the peace down there. The chaos will eventually burn itself out once enough blood
    has been shed for the watch to intervene or a new boss claims the vacant throne.
    However, many of our faithful have begged us to intervene, and it may be wise
    to offer them our aid.
